---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - TDEE Check"
  description="How TDEE Check handles data: calculators run privately in your browser, what analytics and advertising cookies may be used, and your choices."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
  crumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
    { name: 'Privacy Policy', path: '/privacy-policy/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-10">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink-900">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-500">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">Your calculator data stays on your device</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      All TDEE Check calculators run entirely in your browser. The age, height, weight, and other details you enter are
      processed on your device and are not sent to or stored on our servers. There are no accounts and no sign up.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">What we may collect</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed list-disc pl-6">
      <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> our hosting provider may keep standard technical logs (IP address, browser type, pages visited, time of visit) for security and reliability.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> we may use privacy respecting analytics to understand which pages are useful. These tools may set cookies and report aggregate usage, not the values you type into calculators.</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising:</strong> if ads are shown, advertising partners such as Google AdSense may use cookies to serve and measure ads, including interest based ads where permitted.</li>
      <li><strong>Email:</strong> if you contact us, we receive your email address and the content of your message so we can reply.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">Cookies and your choices</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings at any time, and the calculators will still work. Where
      required, you can manage ad personalization through your Google account settings and industry opt out pages.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">Third parties</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      We do not sell personal data. We share data only with the service providers needed to run the site (hosting,
      analytics, advertising), and only as described above, or when required by law.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">Children</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      This site is written for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">Changes and contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted on this page with a new date. Questions about privacy
      can be sent through our <a class="font-bold text-brand-700 underline" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
